  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2666342667ed35e49a322785f6f47e64, type: 3}
  m_Name: AzBeta
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  paragraphs:
  - speakerName: ???
    text: Need a hand?
  - speakerName: Momo
    text: And what exactly are you supposed to be?
  - speakerName: ???
    text: You may call me Az. I presume you are the shadow of the Soul Devourer,
      am I mistaken?
  - speakerName: Momo
    text: "Huh? No, you\u2019ve got it all wrong. I\u2019m just looking for my body,
      I know it\u2019s somewhere in this tower."
  - speakerName: Az
    text: "Are you certain it isn\u2019t, by chance, the body of the Soul Devourer?
      The very one imprisoned in this castle and stripped of its mind through ritual?"
  - speakerName: Momo
    text: "I have nothing to do with that beast! I swear, I\u2019m human."
  - speakerName: Az
    text: I would not dare contradict one who might one day decide to devour me.
  - speakerName: Momo
    text: "I\u2026 I don\u2019t eat anyone! I\u2019m not a monster!"
  - speakerName: Az
    text: Very well, very well. In any case, I wish to help you reach the top of
      the tower. The hag who imprisoned you also saw fit to trap me within this book.
  - speakerName: Az
    text: "I must admit, I\u2019m not one to easily forget such treatment."
  - speakerName: Az
    text: I can tell you how to break the seal on the door leading to the upper floor.
  - speakerName: Momo
    text: "All right, I\u2019m listening."
  - speakerName: Az
    text: "You\u2019ll need to make sure both gems are in place."
  - speakerName: Az
    text: I know that one of them requires focusing a beam of light onto a specific
      spot. You should find a dedicated chamber ahead.
  - speakerName: Az
    text: The other requires placing three ingredients into that cauldron.
  - speakerName: Az
    text: The first is a jar containing a green substance, it should be somewhere
      in this room.
  - speakerName: Az
    text: The second is the inactive gem itself, which should be located in the laboratory.
  - speakerName: Az
    text: "Lastly, you\u2019ll need a catalyst: a small glowing crystal, also likely
      to be in the lab."
  - speakerName: Momo
    text: "Got it. I\u2019ll get to work."
